#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php:150
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Xorro Wallet Payments requires WordPress %s or higher (WordPress 7.0 "
"recommended)."
msgstr ""
"Xorro Portfel Płatności wymaga WordPress %s lub wyższy (WordPress 7.0 "
"zalecane)."

#. translators: %s: WooCommerce version
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php:171
